@Host = http://localhost:5140

### 1. Process Valid Checkout (Emits Traces & Metrics)
POST {{Host}}/api/checkout/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust_vip_1001",
  "amount": 349.99,
  "paymentMethod": "CreditCard"
}

### 2. Process Invalid Checkout (Sets Activity Error Status)
POST {{Host}}/api/checkout/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "amount": -10.00,
  "paymentMethod": "PayPal"
}

### 3. Get Current Trace Context
GET {{Host}}/api/checkout/trace
traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01

### 4. Get Metrics Summary
GET {{Host}}/api/checkout/metrics-summary
